.el .ds Aq '
.TH FATHOM_MCP_TOOLS 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-mcp\-tools \- Print the tool surface and its bounds as this repository\*(Aqs config resolves them
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom mcp tools\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the tool surface and its bounds as this repository\*(Aqs config resolves them
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository whose `[mcp]` config and index to read
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
The surface as one JSON document on stdout (`fathom.mcp.surface/1`)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
